 opts:["HBIG plus hepatitis B vaccine within 12 hours of birth","Hepatitis B vaccine at 1 month of age or at hospital discharge","Hepatitis B vaccine at 2 months of age","Hepatitis B vaccine within 24 hours, counted as the first dose of a three-dose series","Defer vaccination until body weight reaches 2,500 g"],
